        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Amazing home, right on the beach with fantastic access to Rosemary Beach town as well; nice community pool. Plenty of space for a full family and kids and very nicely kept up! I would suggest having a book for the home, there were a few things we didn't know about until the end of our stay. I'd also suggest adding a dresser/drawers to the upstairs loft bedroom. Otherwise it's perfect!",
